  ncells='5 cells: C1 and C2 and R1 to R3',
  red1="At the tip the route's outer catch answers 500 for an unreadable value (the inner catch's own read throws), so the status assertion fails",
  dbnote="The data layer (`../repositories/documentRepo` over an in-memory store, `../repositories/certificationRepo` whose `deleteCertification` throws the chosen value, `../db`, `../services/chargeEvents`, `../utils/notificationClient`, `../events`, `../middleware/auth`, `../utils/logger`) is mocked as in the pinned ref suite; the anchoring call is made to reject with an ordinary Error by replacing the global `fetch` with a plain function for the duration of the cell; NODE_ENV is set to production for the duration of ONE cell, after the real winston logger module is loaded, and restored after each cell; the real `certificationsRouter` is mounted on a real loopback Express server. No database and no network.",
